      "writtenOn": "2018-06-26T13:54:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "the PD_LPM_FLAGS_ENGAGED is meant to track the hardware state directly. We would need to ensure that it was updated appropriately. I think I have gotten all of the hardware entry/exit points taken care of though. Can you think of another way that the hardware low-power state changes?",
